    "about": "【Your apartment】\nYour apartment has at least 20 m² and is smartly and stylishly furnished. At the same time, you have endless scope for creativity to design your flat so that YOU feel comfortable! Plenty of storage space as well as your own kitchenette and bathroom add the finishing touches to your own perfect 4 walls.\n【LOCATION】\nYour new home at the student accommodation in Bonn is located in the former capital of Germany where the widespread reputation of city of the arts is made. But next to the arts and history is even more to enjoy!\nDiscover: Uncountable museums, parks, sights and markets are waiting for you to be visited in you free time. Even the pedestrian zone in Bonn is filled with great architecture and fascinating memorials. The cute cafés and the artistic shops are another bonus point of the student city.\nCelebrate: MILESTONE is infamous for throwing unforgettable parties, you will once you are here. But in case you want to get out of the student housing, Bonn also offers amazing opportunities to party. Within the city centre you’ll find artists shows, cocktail bars, concerts, clubs and everything else, you want to find.\nMove: Which sport do you enjoy the most? Trekking, biking, running, swimming or walking? Whatever you like best, your sportive needs will be fixed in Bonn. However, … the best way to get your daily routine is at our own gym in your future student accommodation in Bonn.\nThe fine arts, delicious produce from local farmers that sell their products daily. The city is filled with busy pedestrian zones in the city centre of Bonn. The incredible architecture and monuments with a mix of small cafes and unique stores is what makes this city great for students. Due to the high number of students, you certainly won’t get bored here!",
